{"Hardcoded 10MB JS limit at utilities.js:182 bypasses admin settings for all upload types - non-image uploads exceeding site settings pass client validation but get rejected server-side": 0.9368636608123779, "Download limit in uploads_controller.rb:55 hardcoded to 10MB applies to ALL API uploads, not just images, wasting bandwidth for non-image files that will be rejected later": 0.8740448355674744, "OptimizedImage.downsize at uploads_controller.rb:67 uses same path for input and output - if ImageMagick fails mid-write, original tempfile is corrupted and passed to Upload.create_for, potentially creating broken upload record": 0.834181547164917}